# === Mobile (Expo) ===
# Capacitor was superseded by the React Native/Expo app (2026-05-24).
# 2026-06-02: pivoted off EAS to local Gradle via `expo prebuild`.
# mobile/android/ is now COMMITTED so the build environment is
# reproducible across machines (and CI can build without a prebuild
# step). mobile/ios/ stays ignored — we're not building iOS today.
# Secrets that used to live in EAS secrets now live in
# mobile/keystore.properties (gitignored via mobile/.gitignore) or
# ~/.gradle/gradle.properties (user-global, outside the repo).
mobile/ios/
mobile/.expo/
